  "releaseNotes": "1.4.1 — tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.4.1 in lockstep. Documentation and packaging patch only: corrects README install snippets and version references that still cited 1.3.0. No changes to the tool's commands or behavior. No change to the .pqfe v2 container format, which remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
